"""NSProxy-style URL session delegate instrumentation: model the crash scenario.

Models the Firebase Performance / PAGWeakProxy scenario where an NSProxy
wrapper holds a weak reference to a URLSession delegate, and CFNetwork
walks a chain of proxies to find a real target that responds to a selector.
We capture the core entities (proxy wrapper, weak target, real delegate,
URL session) as node archetypes and walk the delegate-invalidation
chain with a typed-edge walker.
"""

node Session {
    has name: str = "";
    has invalidated: bool = False;
}

node Proxy {
