"""School Canonical Bidding Engine: canonical vs external knowledge bases and audit walks.

Models the two machine-readable knowledge bases from the School of Sports
Bridge bidding program (SCHOOL CANON + WORLD / EXTERNAL KNOWLEDGE), the
provenance/approval lifecycle of a canonical rule, and a walker that audits
the gap between the active canon and the live external evidence available
for a given auction context.
