"""HIER benchmark model: ontology classes, hierarchical indices, and traversal.

Models the essential scenario from issue #353: real ontologies (NCBI, ATC,
Gene Ontology, MITRE ATT&CK) loaded as a hierarchy, indexed two ways
(nested-set for narrow trees, 2-hop for wide DAGs like GO), and walked by
a traversal walker that handles the four challenge shapes — narrow tree,
multi-parent DAG, wide DAG (decline path), and prefix-coded strict tree.

