Scenario: an upstream sMRIPrep stage populates anat derivatives (ribbon mask,
preproc T2w, fsaverage sphere) that the downstream fMRIPrep stages should
reuse via ``--derivatives`` rather than regenerate. A ``ResidueAuditor`` walker
