server runs. The bug is that `up` reads the KCL-rendered Path straight off
the Frontend node, while a GitSource frontend has no path until it is
resolved into a source dir. We model the three lanes (build, deploy, up)
as walkers that share a Resolver walker; only the Resolver actually
traverses the source tree to materialize a source dir. `up` without the
resolve step runs npm in the empty Path, mirroring the original bug."""

