"""Spec-driven delivery pipeline modeled as a typed-edge graph.

Models the repo-score scenario: intent, design, tasks, and summary artifacts
flow through a three-phase pipeline (Intent → Design → Tasks+Summary). A
walker audits the pipeline by following typed ``Produces`` edges, enforces
phase ordering, detects missing artifacts, and flags tasks whose validation
prerequisites have not been satisfied.
